Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:21.86,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,"DUNIA INI SULIT BAGI MOB"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.49,0:23:41.88,sign,,0000,0000,0000,,SUTRADARA UTAMA\NKAZUYA MIURA
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.60,0:00:09.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perang sudah berakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.71,0:00:12.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Fanoss dan Kerajaan Holfort\Nmenandatangani perjanjian damai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.83,0:00:18.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Negara-negara lain ikut berperang\Nkarena melihat peluang untuk menyerang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.28,0:00:21.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Holfort tak bisa buang waktu dan sumber daya\Nuntuk Kerajaan Fanoss.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:26.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namun, negeri bernama\NKerajaan Fanoss kini lenyap,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.77,0:00:30.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan menjadi duchy vasal Fanoss\Ndi bawah Kerajaan Holfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.93,0:00:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kerajaan Holfort bukan hanya menuntut\Nganti rugi dalam jumlah besar,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:41.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi juga coba memaksa mereka
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:44.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}menyetujui perjanjian\Nyang tidak adil dan memalukan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.25,0:00:45.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Mylene.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.92,0:00:50.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sementara itu, aku sendiri tidak bisa\Nmenyembunyikan kegembiraanku
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.84,0:00:53.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena para putri bangsawan\Nberebut perhatianku...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.81,0:01:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Viscount Bartfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.33,0:01:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku punya permintaan pribadi untukmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.84,0:01:08.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Nona Mylene! Tolong jangan begini!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:09.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada apa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:12.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:15.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}selamatkan Julius dan teman-temannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.26,0:01:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:21.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian benar-benar bodoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.87,0:01:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bartfort...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.52,0:01:26.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak mau dieksekusi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.94,0:01:29.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamatkan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:35.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sendiri yang cari masalah.\NSi bodoh itu menyerang duchy Fanoss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.84,0:01:38.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku cuma bikin sedikit keributan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:41.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak sudi dijadikan alat politik
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.26,0:01:44.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan dipaksa menikahi Hertrude
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.14,0:01:46.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}sebagai bagian dari perjanjian\Nyang tidak adil!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.88,0:01:50.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau bikin Kerajaan Holfort kehilangan muka
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.01,0:01:53.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan harus merundingkan ulang perjanjian itu\Ndengan banyak konsesi.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.30,0:02:00.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak kusangka pangeran bodoh itu\Nakan meminta bantuanku...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.05,0:02:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lalu, kalian berempat mengamuk di Kuil?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.73,0:02:10.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami cuma mencegah mereka mengeksekusi Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.58,0:02:13.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimanapun, dia Saint kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.84,0:02:16.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami sama sekali tidak menyesali\Ntindakan kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.26,0:02:18.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Inilah wujud kekesatriaan kami!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.35,0:02:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bagaimanapun juga, kalian menjadikan\NIstana dan Kuil sebagai musuh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.50,0:02:24.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima nasib kalian dan matilah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.94,0:02:28.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak! Aku tidak mau! Selamatkan aku!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.75,0:02:31.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Agh...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.37,0:02:33.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sudah gila?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:38.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau mau menukar hadiah perangmu\Ndemi menyelamatkan mereka?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.36,0:02:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Kalau hadiah itu belum cukup,\Nakan kuserahkan seluruh kekayaanku.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:44.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong ampuni mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.79,0:02:47.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmm... Bagaimana, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.82,0:02:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pakai mikir segala! Dasar berengsek.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.91,0:02:54.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Viscount, kenapa kau sampai sejauh ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.28,0:02:58.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin karena nasib kami\Nsudah telanjur terikat satu sama lain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.17,0:03:04.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, sejujurnya,\Naku hanya ingin hidup damai sebagai baronet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.02,0:03:07.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mau pakai kesempatan ini\Nuntuk memulai dari awal.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.44,0:03:11.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.09,0:03:14.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pangeran sudah menemukan teman yang baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.99,0:03:19.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yang Mulia,\Nbolehkah aku yang mengatur hal ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:20.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.51,0:03:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, baiklah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.44,0:03:29.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat! Sekarang, aku resmi pensiun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Awal kehidupan sebagai mob yang baru bagiku!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.31,0:03:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, dan soal Angelica...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.95,0:03:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.45,0:03:40.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jangan lakukan itu, Bartfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.12,0:03:42.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sudah gila?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam! Marie, kau akan jadi karat\Ndi pedang Murasame!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.38,0:03:49.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke-Kenapa kau punya barang langka itu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.28,0:03:51.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah menyelamatkanmu, 'kan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.09,0:03:55.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau membuat Ange dan Livia\Nberlutut di depanmu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.18,0:03:55.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:04:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eng, itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.86,0:04:05.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ange sampai mencoreng nama keluarganya\Ndemi menanggung penghinaan itu,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:08.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan dia serta Livia jadi terluka.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.68,0:04:10.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau harus mati!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:11.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan kubunuh kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.52,0:04:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.90,0:04:16.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hentikan!\NTakkan kubiarkan kau menyentuh Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:18.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam! Luxion, lakukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.36,0:04:19.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau yakin?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.32,0:04:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lakukan!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.77,0:04:24.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau begitu, permisi...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.96,0:04:33.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Kenapa aku kena juga?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.38,0:04:35.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah tenang sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.24,0:04:39.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pulau terapung di wilayahmu, Kak?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.77,0:04:42.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.28,0:04:42.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.49,0:04:48.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian hidup mandiri di sana.\NSemacam hidup di pengasingan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.87,0:04:51.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa? Aku tidak mau begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.97,0:04:54.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah menyelamatkanmu!\NJangan banyak mengeluh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sebegitu inginnya kehilangan kepala?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.40,0:04:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Maksudku, kau tahu sendiri,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.24,0:05:01.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}aku ini gadis kota tulen, 'kan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.51,0:05:05.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau cuma mau bikin harem baru lagi\Ndi ibu kota!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.54,0:05:07.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Padahal di kehidupan yang lalu,\Nkau ibu-ibu yang sudah punya anak!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.77,0:05:12.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam! Kau sendiri mengoleksi\Ntokoh jahat dan tokoh utama!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.80,0:05:16.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hubungan kami ini platonis!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.62,0:05:17.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tidak kayak kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:19.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau cuma perjaka pengecut!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.33,0:05:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mati gara-gara kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.39,0:05:24.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luxion, kau juga, bilang sesuatu!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.51,0:05:25.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.42,0:05:28.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Orang tua kalian di kehidupan yang lalu\Nharus menghadapi kalian berdua.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.16,0:05:30.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku kasihan pada mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.60,0:05:39.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan, seperti kata Marie,\Nmungkin sudah waktunya kau memutuskan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.68,0:05:42.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau ini bicara apa, sih?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.73,0:05:45.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya mereka sudah datang.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.48,0:05:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.31,0:05:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.05,0:05:55.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami ingin bicara denganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.39,0:05:58.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada waktu sebentar?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.36,0:06:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ma-Mau bicara soal apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:08.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon, aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.77,0:06:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.57,0:06:16.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Entah sejak kapan, aku jadi lebih sering\Nmemikirkanmu daripada Pangeran.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.16,0:06:19.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bersamamu terasa menyenangkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.72,0:06:23.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya nyaman berdiri di sampingmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.80,0:06:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mencintaimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.98,0:06:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.30,0:06:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ke-Kenapa senyumnya begitu?!\NAku harus apa sekarang?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.17,0:06:37.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luxion, bantu aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.98,0:06:40.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Siapa kau?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.93,0:06:43.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hai! Aku Creare!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.71,0:06:46.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, AI yang di Vice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.48,0:06:47.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lama tidak bertemu!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.31,0:06:50.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Suara itu...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.28,0:06:53.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu, bukankah kau AI di reruntuhan elf?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.82,0:06:56.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku minta dia memindahkanku ke sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.27,0:06:58.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:01.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bukan, nanti saja! Luxion di mana?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.62,0:07:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia kadang tidak tahu suasana,\Njadi kusuruh dia pergi.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.10,0:07:06.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia dengan senang hati menurut!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.92,0:07:09.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Robot itu!\NDia menjerumuskanku ke kandang singa!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.74,0:07:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.59,0:07:11.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.58,0:07:15.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku masih mencintaimu sampai sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.08,0:07:19.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Menurutku, tidak ada yang bisa mencintaimu\Nlebih dari aku.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.71,0:07:21.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Be-Begitu...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.22,0:07:22.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa yang sedang kutonton ini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.22,0:07:26.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, tolong beri jawabanmu di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.81,0:07:28.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Livia atau aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.59,0:07:31.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, tidak harus salah satu dari kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.07,0:07:34.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Katakan perasaanmu yang sebenarnya!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.94,0:07:38.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perasaanku yang sebenarnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.37,0:07:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.32,0:07:55.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mencintai kalian berdua!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.70,0:08:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah naik ke gelar kebangsawanan\Nperingkat keenam
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.69,0:08:03.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}karena menyelamatkan banyak pengungsi.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.01,0:08:07.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang dia membantu\Nperbaikan Arroganz dan Partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.92,0:08:13.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah dia meninggalkan Zola,\Nkediaman Zola di ibu kota terbakar habis,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.29,0:08:19.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan karena keluarganya menolak membantu\Ndalam perang, keluarga itu dibubarkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:25.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kelihatannya chauvinisme wanita di ibu kota\Nperlahan mulai berubah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.03,0:08:27.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau aku...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Viscount Leon Fou Bartfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.85,0:08:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau telah meraih prestasi luar biasa\Nselama perang!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.55,0:08:40.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ngantuk. Cepat selesaikan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.03,0:08:41.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmph!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:45.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dengan ini,\Nkuakhiri jabatanmu sebagai panglima tertinggi
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.73,0:08:50.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kuberikan gelar Count peringkat ketiga.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.25,0:08:52.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.35,0:08:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau ngomong apa barusan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.77,0:09:02.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Prestasi militer yang hebat harus diganjar\Ndengan pangkat yang setara.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:06.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Count di usia semuda itu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.57,0:09:08.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu pangkat tertinggi\Ndi luar keluarga kerajaan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.77,0:09:10.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenaikan pangkat yang terlalu ekstrem\Nuntuk seorang pemula.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.70,0:09:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bahkan Nona Mylene dan yang lain\Nikut melongo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.53,0:09:19.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia memutuskannya dadakan!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.75,0:09:21.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma buat menjahiliku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.54,0:09:25.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hmph. Itu ganjaran\Nkarena kau merusak dramaku.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.52,0:09:28.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau memintanya, Yang Mulia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.54,0:09:30.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia menghancurkan rencanaku!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.42,0:09:34.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Count, aku menantikan kiprah besarmu\Ndi masa depan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.53,0:09:40.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.98,0:09:44.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Suatu hari akan kubalas kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.68,0:09:47.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Naik pangkat lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.96,0:09:51.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau dapat perlakuan istimewa,\Nsementara aku diasingkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.98,0:09:55.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam. Kau tidak tahu apa yang harus kujalani.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.43,0:09:57.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagian, kau mau apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.56,0:10:00.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sebenarnya, aku punya informasi\Nyang sangat penting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.55,0:10:02.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Soal gim otome itu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.77,0:10:03.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.19,0:10:08.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau mati setelah menamatkan gimnya,\Njadi kau tidak tahu soal ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.35,0:10:11.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gim itu ternyata bagian dari sebuah seri.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Apa?! Gim menyebalkan itu?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.35,0:10:15.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.53,0:10:19.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak ada yang peduli,\Ntapi penerbitnya semangat banget.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.96,0:10:22.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Su-Sulit dipercaya.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:26.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pokoknya, bos akhir gim pertama itu\NDewa Penjaga Daratan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.54,0:10:30.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dewa Penjaga Langit dan Laut\Nbaru muncul di gim ketiga.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.69,0:10:31.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Begitu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.83,0:10:35.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, gim ketiga tercampur\Nke dalam gim pertama?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.33,0:10:37.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pantas aku belum pernah lihat mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.91,0:10:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.01,0:10:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu sebentar. Jangan bilang...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.40,0:10:44.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul! Bos gim kedua masih ada!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.69,0:10:46.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia masih dalam bahaya!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:49.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mustahil!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.73,0:10:51.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah paham sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.67,0:10:55.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku tahu apa yang terjadi di gim,\Nsedangkan kau tidak.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.24,0:10:57.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, ayo kita buat kesepakatan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.85,0:11:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau... sebenarnya mau apa?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:03.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu, pertama-tama...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.42,0:11:08.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tolong kirimi aku uang saku!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.98,0:11:09.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.20,0:11:12.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Carla dan Kyle sih aman,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.37,0:11:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}tapi lima orang itu\Ntidak berguna sama sekali di desa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.57,0:11:21.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau tahu sendiri mereka tidak becus!\NPersis semua pacarku di kehidupan yang lalu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.42,0:11:23.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berkilau!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:26.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Astaga, kau ini magnet cowok sampah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.65,0:11:30.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya sudah, akan kukirimi kau uang saku.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.55,0:11:33.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, Kakak!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.61,0:11:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak usah begitu.\NCeritakan saja apa yang terjadi di gim kedua.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.37,0:11:39.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oke.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.86,0:11:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Gim kedua tidak berlatar di Kerajaan Holfort,\Ntapi di Republik Alzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.09,0:11:46.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Republik Alzer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.91,0:11:49.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tempat pertukaran pelajar itu?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.54,0:11:53.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di gim kedua, kalau protagonisnya\Ntidak menjalin hubungan romantis,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.92,0:11:55.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}seluruh dunia akan kiamat...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.44,0:12:03.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa aku tidak boleh istirahat sama sekali?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.61,0:12:06.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau terlalu mencemaskan segalanya, Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.25,0:12:10.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau akhirnya memutuskan ikut\Npertukaran pelajar ke Republik Alzer.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.92,0:12:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Memangnya aku bisa apa lagi?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.80,0:12:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sudah banyak yang berubah dari gim pertama,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.04,0:12:19.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan kalau ada orang semacam Marie\Ndi luar sana, kita bisa repot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.32,0:12:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau tetap di Kerajaan Holfort,\Nkau akan diburu banyak orang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.10,0:12:27.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya ampun,\Nsesulit apa sih dunia ini bagi seorang mob?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.80,0:12:28.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.90,0:12:31.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.09,0:12:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ada waktu sebentar?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.72,0:12:36.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Upacara pertunangan?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.14,0:12:39.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, aku ingin kau hadir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.75,0:12:42.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah, ternyata Kakak lebih laku\Ndari yang kukira!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.87,0:12:45.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Berhasil dapat pasangan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.49,0:12:47.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, begitulah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.31,0:12:52.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Karena masih sebelum pertukaran dimulai,\Ndengan senang hati aku akan hadir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.30,0:12:58.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tunggu sebentar.\NKayaknya ada yang janggal di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.53,0:13:01.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakak kan yang jadi bintang utamanya?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.18,0:13:04.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa bajuku lebih bagus daripada dia?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.73,0:13:06.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Itu, kau tahu...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.92,0:13:09.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau kan seorang count.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:10.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.05,0:13:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Luxion, kau tidak merasa ada yang aneh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.19,0:13:18.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Masa? Mereka semua cuma sedang gugup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.73,0:13:21.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak, jelas ada yang tidak beres.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.23,0:13:23.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkinkah ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:38.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah! Ayah menipuku!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.64,0:13:43.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, aku tidak salah apa-apa.\NKau saja yang salah paham.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.22,0:13:49.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau terlalu lama ragu, jadi kami putuskan\Nuntuk langsung mengaturnya.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:52.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bisa-bisanya kalian tega begini padaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.46,0:13:57.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Semua petinggi ada di sini?!\NAku tidak bisa kabur!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.25,0:13:59.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Count.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:03.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat.\NAku datang membawa surat dari Yang Mulia.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.74,0:14:05.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah? Yang Mulia?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.94,0:14:12.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kudengar kau berusaha keras\Nmenghindari pernikahan,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}jadi aku turun tangan.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.56,0:14:17.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat datang di kuburan masa bujangmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.81,0:14:21.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tertanda, Raja yang hebat dan cakap.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:25.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan kau!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.21,0:14:34.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maaf sudah menjebakmu begini.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.05,0:14:38.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Habisnya kau selalu berusaha menghindar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.08,0:14:42.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kalian harus jatuh cinta padaku?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.20,0:14:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jatuh cinta padamu\Nkarena kau adalah dirimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.26,0:14:47.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon, jadilah suamiku.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.16,0:14:52.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku jatuh cinta padamu\Nkarena kau adalah dirimu.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.48,0:14:56.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku takkan pernah melepaskanmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.12,0:15:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya, terserah saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.03,0:15:10.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Yah, bohong kalau kubilang\Naku tidak suka mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.11,0:15:12.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku mencintai mereka.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.01,0:15:19.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku memang dijebak,\Ntapi rasanya tidak buruk juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.73,0:15:24.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Selamat atas pertunanganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.49,0:15:27.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Upacaranya luar biasa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.76,0:15:31.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Cuma itu yang mau kalian bilang,\Ndasar bola-bola rongsokan?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.69,0:15:34.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Besok aku berangkat pertukaran pelajar.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.97,0:15:38.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergi sehari setelah bertunangan...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.59,0:15:40.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:47.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Eeeh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.52,0:15:49.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku belum siap!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.71,0:15:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengintip.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.81,0:15:55.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau pikir kami datang untuk apa?\NKami cuma mau ngobrol denganmu.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.40,0:15:56.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hah?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.31,0:16:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita jarang punya waktu buat ngobrol santai.\NKau keberatan?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.20,0:16:03.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Bu-Bukannya tidak mau! Ya, mau!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.09,0:16:09.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami ingin berterima kasih.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.31,0:16:13.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Banyak hal terjadi\Nsejak kami bertemu denganmu, Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.90,0:16:17.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau selalu ada di sisi kami.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.10,0:16:20.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau sudah menyelamatkan kami\Ndalam banyak hal.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.43,0:16:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ange... Livia...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.14,0:16:29.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku juga sama.\NEntah apa jadinya aku tanpa kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.98,0:16:33.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Terima kasih, kalian berdua.\NMarie dan yang lain juga.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.72,0:16:35.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Betul.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.44,0:16:37.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon, pastikan kau pulang.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.50,0:16:41.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami akan menunggumu.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.26,0:16:44.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Aku janji.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.94,0:16:51.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Setelah itu,\Nkami mengobrol sampai larut malam.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.41,0:16:55.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rasanya seperti digiring\Nke tempat penjagalan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.93,0:17:04.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Rauda...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.90,0:17:07.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Semua orang sudah pergi sekarang.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.56,0:17:13.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayah, Ibu, bahkan Vandel sudah tiada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.81,0:17:21.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tanpamu, kakakmu ini sendirian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Andai saja aku lebih waspada.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.59,0:17:32.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang aku teringat\Nucapan Kepala Suku desa elf.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.21,0:17:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon Fou Bartfort...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.29,0:17:44.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jika kau bisa berjalan bersama mereka,\Ncahaya akan menyinari jalan sulitmu,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:47.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}dan mereka akan menjadi dukungan\Nyang bisa diandalkan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.69,0:17:52.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akhirnya tiba waktunya berlayar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.32,0:17:58.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kasihan Leon. Dia akhirnya\Ndibanjiri undangan dari para gadis.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.41,0:18:00.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sementara itu, kita dielu-elukan bak pahlawan
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.68,0:18:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}setelah mengevakuasi warga!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.33,0:18:05.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sekarang semua cewek jadi milik kita!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.32,0:18:07.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}- Semua cewek! Semua cewek!\N- Awas kalian, ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.66,0:18:09.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.63,0:18:11.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, kalian.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.32,0:18:19.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalau kau bosan dengan Keluarga Redgrave,\Nkau selalu bisa datang ke Keluarga Atlee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.83,0:18:23.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Keluarga Roseblade siap\Nmenyambutmu kapan saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.87,0:18:26.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hei, bagaimana kalau kita...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.09,0:18:28.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kawin lari sekarang?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.30,0:18:30.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan Leon.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:32.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Guru!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.33,0:18:35.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mengunjungi negeri asing akan jadi\Npengalaman berharga untukmu,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}baik sebagai pria terhormat,\Nmaupun sebagai seorang pria.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.60,0:18:42.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Asahlah kekesatriaanmu lebih jauh\Ndan teruslah melangkah maju.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.45,0:18:43.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:47.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tuan, sudah waktunya berlayar.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.00,0:18:49.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku sudah menyiapkan kapal baru,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.96,0:18:51.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}yang pantas untuk posisimu\Nsebagai wakil Kerajaan Holfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.45,0:18:58.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Hebat! Keren banget!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.99,0:19:03.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Namanya Einhorn.\NKurasa cocok untuk perjalanan hari ini.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Ayo berangkat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.86,0:19:17.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian yakin tidak mau mengantarnya pergi?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.37,0:19:22.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya. Menangis di depan umum\Ncuma akan merepotkannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.90,0:19:24.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Wah! Kau gadis yang baik!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.42,0:19:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Lagi pula, pasti ada alasan\Ndia tiba-tiba ingin ikut pertukaran pelajar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:33.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan belajar giat\Nsupaya suatu hari bisa membantunya!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.73,0:19:39.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kita harus berkembang pesat\Nsampai Leon kaget waktu dia pulang!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.42,0:19:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau benar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.36,0:19:41.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ayo berjuang!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.69,0:19:46.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sial!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.70,0:19:51.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Perpisahannya memang indah,\Ntapi aku tidak mau pergi ke luar negeri!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.83,0:19:54.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kau benar-benar tidak tahu\Nkapan harus pasrah, Tuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.93,0:19:56.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Omong-omong,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:58.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}kau tidak mau buka kotak ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.95,0:20:01.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya ini hadiah dari Istana.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.25,0:20:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Oh, benar. Mereka memberiku sesuatu.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.98,0:20:08.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Mungkin ini hadiah untuk Republik Alzer?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.33,0:20:20.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau tutup lagi?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.54,0:20:23.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kenapa kau ada di sini?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.55,0:20:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Se-Sebenarnya...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.93,0:20:33.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}A-Apa ini?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.26,0:20:36.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami membuatnya untukmu, Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.76,0:20:39.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kami minta tolong pada pematung terkenal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.26,0:20:41.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Harganya lumayan mahal.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.51,0:20:44.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Untung ada uang saku dari Bartfort!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:48.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dia terus-terusan mau bikin dadamu\Nlebih besar. Susah menahannya.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.55,0:20:53.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Me-Mereka menghabiskan uang itu\Nsampai koin terakhir.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.04,0:20:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jatah biaya hidup setahun\Npenuh lenyap begitu saja.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.90,0:21:02.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kalian... dasar cowok-cowok tidak becus!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.15,0:21:09.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Waktu Ratu dengar, dia murka besar.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.37,0:21:17.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sepertinya kalian\Nmasih perlu banyak belajar soal dunia.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.25,0:21:20.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Pergilah belajar ke luar negeri bersama Leon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.09,0:21:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Agh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.64,0:21:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, Julius dan yang lain juga ada di sini.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.04,0:21:29.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Akan seru, nih, Pangeran.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.23,0:21:29.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.28,0:21:31.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Alzer, ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.73,0:21:34.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Di mana pun, asalkan ada Marie.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.28,0:21:36.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Aku akan jadi pria yang pantas bagi Marie!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.76,0:21:39.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Maju, menuju petualangan baru!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.66,0:21:41.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.77,0:21:47.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Jadi, kita akan bareng lagi, Kak...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.29,0:21:50.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Tidak mungkin!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.90,0:21:54.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Ya ampun. Inikah yang disebut\Nkasih sayang saudara yang indah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:21:58.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Kakak dan adik ini memang mirip sekali.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:00.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Diam!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.96,0:22:03.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Sialan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.01,0:22:05.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Dunia gim otome ini...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.58,0:22:11.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}terlalu sulit bagi mob!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.88,0:22:14.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\blur3}{\fad(00,40)}Trapped in a Dating Sim 2: The World\Nof Otome Games is Tough for Mobs
